n a word if the surrounding context signals a semantic transition, as shown by examples where boundaries persist even after whitespace removal [S1].  \nThus, H‑Net dynamically determines cuts by a content‑sensitive, end‑to‑end learned boundary predictor rather than fixed heuristics.", "reasoning_chars": 186}}
