bered items [S1].  \nThe model’s chunking is content‑aware: it can merge multiple words or ignore missing spaces when the surrounding context indicates a semantic boundary, demonstrating that decisions are based on context rather than static rules [S1].  ", "reasoning_chars": 316}}
